			(property "Description" "RJ45 Jack - 8 pin Simple RJ45, 8-pin connection. Commonly used for Cat5, Cat5e, and Cat6 Ethernet cables.\n\nHere is the connector we sell at SparkFun:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/643 RJ45 8-Pin Connector (PRT-00643)\n• https://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Prototyping/04908.pdf Datasheet\n\nIt is used on this SparkFun product:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/716 SparkFun RJ45 Breakout (BOB-00716)\n\nNote, you may also be interested in the \"MAGJACK\" version of this. It is basically a RJ45 connector, but also has some status LEDs built into the connector housing. You can check that out in this library at the device named \"MAGJACK.dev\" and see these products online:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/8534 RJ45 Ethernet MagJack-Compatible (PRT-08534)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13021 SparkFun RJ45 MagJack Breakout (BOB-13021)"
				(at 0 0 0)
